{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to hit the ice in a fast-paced, physics-driven hockey simulation that puts you in complete control. Every pass, shot, and body check is powered by realistic physics, making each game unpredictable, skill-based, and endlessly replayable. Whether you're a die-hard hockey fan or just looking for a fun and competitive sports experience, this game delivers high-intensity action with fluid gameplay and dynamic mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill-Based Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stick controls are designed to offer a high level of precision and depth, allowing you to execute skillful plays, react to dynamic puck physics, and outmaneuver your opponents with finesse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/puck_lead.gif?t=1742339061\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Team Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puck isn\u2019t just about skill - it\u2019s about working together to create game-changing moments. Whether you're threading a perfect pass through defenders, setting up a teammate for a one-timer, or executing a seamless give-and-go, teamwork is at the heart of every unforgettable play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/baseball.gif?t=1742339061\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/bodycheck.gif?t=1742339061\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick Your Role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every great hockey team needs both fearless skaters and rock-solid goaltenders. Whether you thrive on the rush as a forward, dominate the blue line as a defenseman, or guard the net as a last line of defense, your role on the ice is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/save.gif?t=1742339061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994020?t=1742339061","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/85b28b750771dd082338b85355b6668e53bb1b53/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742339061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/1adfa70f9a4a0c2948660b9fa0e0125af770d398/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742339061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/1adfa70f9a4a0c2948660b9fa0e0125af770d398/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742339061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to hit the ice in a fast-paced, physics-driven hockey simulation that puts you in complete control. Every pass, shot, and body check is powered by realistic physics, making each game unpredictable, skill-based, and endlessly replayable. Whether you're a die-hard hockey fan or just looking for a fun and competitive sports experience, this game delivers high-intensity action with fluid gameplay and dynamic mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill-Based Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stick controls are designed to offer a high level of precision and depth, allowing you to execute skillful plays, react to dynamic puck physics, and outmaneuver your opponents with finesse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/puck_lead.gif?t=1742339061\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Team Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puck isn\u2019t just about skill - it\u2019s about working together to create game-changing moments. Whether you're threading a perfect pass through defenders, setting up a teammate for a one-timer, or executing a seamless give-and-go, teamwork is at the heart of every unforgettable play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/baseball.gif?t=1742339061\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/bodycheck.gif?t=1742339061\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick Your Role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every great hockey team needs both fearless skaters and rock-solid goaltenders. Whether you thrive on the rush as a forward, dominate the blue line as a defenseman, or guard the net as a last line of defense, your role on the ice is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/extras/save.gif?t=1742339061\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Nils Asejevs"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994020/24148cf3fe73bcd5e9d694a2f37be60a4d9a0120/header.jpg?t=1742339061","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257077535,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077535/movie480.mp4?t=1732833685","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077535/movie_max.mp4?t=1732833685"},"name":"Puck Gameplay Trailer",